{"articleNo":"98943","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=98943&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관]2014-1학기 생활관 추가합격자 발표 및 등록 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.01.20","hit":"5817","attachments":[{"name":"2014-1학기재학생추가합격자명단(공고용)(1).xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=98943&attachNo=72234"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014-1학기 재학생 생활관 추가합격자를 다음과 같이 발표하오니 생활관비를 기한내에 납부하시기 바랍니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; ※ 재학생 생활관 합격자 확인 : [원스톱서비스 - 학생지원 - 생활관 - 신청결과] 에서 확인 가능</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 재학생</span></u></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 납부기간</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 1. 21(화) ~ 1. 24(금) 16:00까지</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 나. 납부은행</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 농협은행 전국지점</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 다. 고지서 출력</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 원스톱서비스-생활관-생활관비 고지내역 조회/출력</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong><font color=\"#ea0707\">[생활관 학생회비 10,000원 포함됨]</font></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 라. 농협 방문 납부 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 고지서 지참하여 납부(은행 영업시간 10:00~16:00)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 마. 개인별 가상계좌번호로 생활관비 계좌이체</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹 무통장입금 등 가능(이체수수료 발생 가능)</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 방문 납부 아닐시 17시까지 이체 가능</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">받는 사람(학생 본인 이름) 필히 확인</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 보내는 사람은 학생 이름이 아니라도 상관없음</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0900ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">가상계좌번호는 매학기 변경됨</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; 바. 생활관비 납부 확인 방법</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 은행 확인 : 실시간</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">학교 확인 : 납부 다음날 10:00 이후(원스톱서비스-생활관-납부내역 조회)</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #666666; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #f40000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 납부기간 내 미등록자는 별도의 통보없이 합격을 취소함</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2. 문의</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> : 푸름관(478-7943, 7944), 오름관(478-7202) </span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014. 1. 20</span></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">금오공과대학교생활관</span></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
